    "stand_in_heights_doc": "M3-BPR-420 (ADR 0041): the Act I creatures' real heights (the top of each battle model's bounds above its feet; a flier's body above its hover), so hit, status and KO effects, damage numbers and markers land on the body, not at the 1.7 m default (a hit floated a metre over the Oil Slug and struck the Spar-Wraith's shins). Measured from the models; the Reach waits on its own read.",
